111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YhRSMphB3oMQ7kNvwFgOk2X&_nc_oc=Adp0UN6GRzGr3jyj-2UKbaolH9mlA5W0TAWwlkVpk7zP8U1f0K_l44dwMEIpiY9RRbE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL-3RLXSeplfZ0Hoh-ETnPKxcNgBLSPLSoeo1XH2R_i3A&oe=6A996DF5"}, "display_name": "Lift Shift Drift", "keywords": ["gliding", "flying", "Challenge", "LSD", "highscore"], "long_description": "# The most thrilling and high-speed VR gliding game\n\n\nSpread your arms, glide through narrow gaps between terrains and obstacles to score big!\n\nExplore endless uncharted realms and feel the ultimate freedom and exhilaration of flight.\n\n{1152277559579439}\n# Experience Unmatched VR Immersion\n\n\nTake full control of the gliding by tilting and spreading your arms. Feel every gust of wind!\n{546401181779274}\n# Easy to Learn, Hard to Master\n\n\nSimple arm movements to start, but limitless techniques to perfect!\n{635752632259829}\n\n\n# High Risk, High Return\n\n\nCloser flights to obstacles mean higher scores, more adrenaline, and bigger thrills!\n\n\n{1334180918008308}\n# Endless Content to Keep You Engaged\n\nUnlock new gear with every mission you complete, bringing fresh challenges to every gliding!\n\n{1363203888420717}\n**Lift into the unknown, Shift through danger, Drift across endless horizons.**\n\nBecome a Rifter today and dive into the **ultimate VR gliding adventure!**\n\n", "short_description": "LiftShiftDrift is a standalone VR game for Meta Quest. Experience high-speed gliding, immersive exploration, and thrilling challenges as you create your own adventure in a stunning wireless VR world!"}]}, "developer_name": "KapeHorn", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.liftshiftdrift.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.liftshiftdrift.com/terms-of-service-1", "publisher_name": "KapeHorn", "support_website_url": "https://www.liftshiftdrift.com/faq-1", "website_url": "https://www.liftshiftdrift.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "C